(vector (map (:db/id -1)
  (:adr/id "adr-2607171400-cloud-itonami-municipality-culture-catalog")
  (:adr/title "ADR-2607171400: cloud-itonami-municipality-* — 地域文化カタログ（特産・食事・祭事・遺産）の相乗り")
  (:adr/status "accepted")
  (:adr/doc_type "adr")
  (:adr/topic "cloud-itonami-municipality-culture-catalog")
  (:adr/date "2026-07-17")
  (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-17")
  (:adr/source-format "edn")
  (:adr/authoritative true)
  (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki"))
  (:adr/authoritative_for
  (vector "regional culture data (local dishes, protected products, beverages, crafts, festivals, heritage) lives in the existing cloud-itonami-municipality-<iso3>-<city> repos as a culture.facts namespace, sibling to ordinance.facts — no new repo family, no ooyake-side registry"
   "entry shape :culture/{id,name,name-local,municipality,country,kind,summary,url,url-provenance,retrieved-at} with kind in #{:dish :beverage :product :craft :festival :heritage}"
   "provenance discipline identical to the compliance-fact family: every entry's url actually fetched and read on retrieved-at, summaries assert only what the source confirms, national-not-city items labeled honestly, zero fabrication"
   "data/culture-tx.edn is generated from culture.facts/catalog (gen script), never hand-written; a tx-parity test enforces it"))
  (:adr/related (vector "adr-2607141700-cloud-itonami-compliance-fact-federation"
                "adr-2607032330-cloud-itonami-iso3166-market-entry-compliance-blueprints"
                "adr-2607171600-docs-adr-edn-only-datascript"))
  (:adr/supersedes (vector))
  (:adr/superseded_by (vector))
  (:adr/problem "オーナー依頼: 世界の地域ごとの特産・食事（例: ローマ=カルボナーラ）を EDN でデータ化したい。既存の EDN データセットは存在しない（検索でヒットするのは ISIC coverage / 企業シード / UNSPSC の偶然一致のみ）。一方、地域の骨格は ooyake gov-units（世界行政区 atlas）と cloud-itonami-municipality-<iso3>-<city>（44都市の条例 compliance カタログ、ADR-2607141700）に既に整備済みで、ゼロから地域体系を発明する理由がない。")
  (:adr/decision "既存44 municipality repo への相乗り（オーナー決定 2026-07-17「では相乗りでいきましょう 文化データも含めて」）。各 repo に culture.facts 名前空間を追加する: src/culture/facts.cljc（catalog 正本 + spec-basis/coverage/by-kind）、schema/culture.edn（DataScript schema）、data/culture-tx.edn（生成物）、test/culture/facts_test.clj（count/uniqueness/coverage/by-kind/tx-parity）。ordinance.facts と同一の捏造禁止・実 fetch 検証・出典必須規律。")
  (:adr/consequences
  (vector "(+) 地域 ID 体系（municipality slug + ISO3、ooyake capitals 由来）を再発明せず、既存 compliance-fact 群と同じ DataScript db に union できる"
   "(+) 検証実測: 推測した Wikipedia URL の約1/3が実際に404（Frascati_wine / Festa_de%27_Noantri / Historic_Centre_of_Rome）— 実 fetch 検証の義務化が捏造を現実に防いだ"
   "(-) compliance repo に文化データが同居する（却下した ooyake 側分離案の純度を失う）— :culture/* namespace 分離により query 上の混線はない"
   "(-) スコープは既存44都市どまり。国レベル（iso3166 repo への :culture 追加）・都市の追加は将来 wave"
   "follow-up: scripts/compliance-fact-query.cljs の SOURCES に culture-tx.edn を追加して横断 query に載せる"
   "follow-up: 44 municipality repo は west.yml / fleet-db 未登録（ADR-2607141700 時点からの継続状態）— 登録判断は別 ADR"))
  (:adr/addenda "[{:addendum 1, :date \"2026-07-17\", :title \"Wave 0 complete: 44/44 municipality repos landed\", :artifacts {:reference-impl \"ita-roma 4767d47 (9 entries, done inline)\", :agent-batches \"6 parallel fresh agents: Asia 8 / W-Europe 7 / N-Europe 7 / MEA 8 / Americas 7 / S-Am+Oceania 6 = 43 repos, all pushed to each repo's main\", :totals \"396 culture entries across 44 cities; every :culture/url WebFetch-verified on 2026-07-17; ~22 candidate items dropped on verification failure (guessed-title 404s, plus honest association failures e.g. London dry gin whose article explicitly disclaims geographic designation, Spreewald gherkins with no Berlin mention); all suites green (incl. pre-existing ordinance tests), clj-kondo 0/0 everywhere; no force-pushes; shared checkout untouched\", :final-verify \"gh api contents check on all 44 repos: src/culture/facts.cljc + data/culture-tx.edn present=44 missing=0\"}, :note \"national-level items are honestly labeled per the spec; several capitals (Riyadh, Abuja, Nairobi) lost festival entries to 404s and satisfy the festival-or-heritage floor via heritage\"} {:addendum 2, :date \"2026-07-17\", :title \"Wave 1 kickoff: country-level culture in all 188 iso3166 repos + Wave 1b iconic-culture city repos\", :trigger \"owner directive 2026-07-17: さらに coverage を向上\", :decision {:country-level \"add culture.facts to every cloud-itonami-iso3166-<iso3> country repo (188; ministry-level jpn-*/usa-* repos excluded). Catalog keyed by UPPERCASE ISO3 mirroring statute.facts; NO :culture/municipality attr at country level; ids <lowercase-iso3>.<kind>.<slug>; same provenance discipline\", :wave-1b \"new municipality repos for iconic culture cities missing from the 44 (ita-napoli — the owner's original example, ita-milano, ita-firenze, ita-venezia, jpn-osaka, jpn-kyoto, esp-barcelona, deu-munich, fra-marseille, usa-new-orleans), each seeded with >=1 WebFetch-verified official ordinance (family contract, ADR-2607141700) + a culture catalog; if no ordinance verifiable the repo is NOT created (no hollow repos)\"}, :artifacts {:reference-impl \"cloud-itonami-iso3166-ita 995b61b: 10 ITA entries (pizza/spaghetti/gelato/tiramisu/espresso/chianti/parmigiano-reggiano/murano-glass/carnival-of-venice/venice), clojure -M:test 33 tests/107 assertions green in an ISOLATED clone via the sibling-langgraph layout (<work>/kotoba-lang/langgraph satisfies the :local/root dep) — this layout is mandatory for fleet agents and is documented in SPEC-COUNTRY.md\", :rollout \"16 agent chunks x ~12 countries in 2 tranches + 2 city agents\"}, :note \"completion tally lands as addendum 3\"} {:addendum 3, :date \"2026-07-17\", :title \"Wave 1 + Wave 1b COMPLETE: 188/188 iso3166 countries, 54/54 municipality repos (44 original + 10 new) -- full family coverage\", :artifacts {:country-level \"188/188 cloud-itonami-iso3166-<iso3> repos carry culture.facts, verified via a GitHub-API sweep (src/culture/facts.cljc present=188 missing=0). 6 pre-existing family gaps discovered and closed by creating the missing repos from scratch: kgz (Kyrgyzstan), lao (Laos), mmr (Myanmar), tjk (Tajikistan), tkm (Turkmenistan), uzb (Uzbekistan) -- none existed on GitHub despite local scaffold directories; each new repo's organization.edn was re-verified against live Wikidata (QID + capital P36) before push\", :p36-bugs-found \"1 of the 6 new-repo re-verifications caught a real data-quality bug matching the addendum-1 precedent (Tokyo/Shigaraki Palace): Laos had :hq/:contact-page pointing to Wikidata Q1461 (Manila, PHILIPPINES) instead of Q9326 (Vientiane) -- the text field said Vientiane correctly but the QID link was wrong. Fixed in the new lao repo only; the root cause in com-etzhayyim-ooyake gov-units.capitals.edn remains unfixed and out of scope, as in addendum 1. kgz/mmr/tjk/tkm/uzb were independently re-verified correct, no bug found\", :wave-1b-cities \"10/10 new cloud-itonami-municipality-* repos created and pushed, each gated on >=1 WebFetch-verified OFFICIAL-domain ordinance per the family contract (ADR-2607141700) plus a 9-entry culture catalog: ita-napoli (the owner's original pizza example -- pizza napoletana entry cites TSG 2010 + UNESCO ICH 2017), ita-milano, ita-firenze, ita-venezia, fra-marseille, jpn-osaka, jpn-kyoto, esp-barcelona, deu-munich, usa-new-orleans\", :rollout-mechanics \"executed via roughly 20 parallel general-purpose subagents across several waves; 9 agents were killed mid-run by a Claude-Code session usage cap (reset 5:30pm JST) after already committing/pushing most of their assigned repos -- a post-mortem GitHub-API sweep, not agent self-report, was used as ground truth to compute the exact remaining gap before relaunching only the unfinished repos, avoiding duplicate work\", :final-verify \"gh api sweep of all 188 iso3166 repos + all 54 municipality repos (44 original + 10 new): src/culture/facts.cljc present count = 188/188 + 54/54\"}, :note \"culture-catalog rollout is complete at both granularities the owner asked for (country and city). Total entry count was not centrally re-summed across roughly 240 repos in this addendum; each batch/agent report already stated its own verified count, and every entry cites a URL fetched the same day\"}]")
  (:adr/body "# ADR-2607171400: cloud-itonami-municipality-* — 地域文化カタログの相乗り\n\n**Status**: accepted — 2026-07-17\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki（オーナー決定「では相乗りでいきましょう 文化データも含めて」）\n**Scope**: orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-municipality-*（既存44 repo のスコープ拡張。新 repo なし）\n\n## Context\n\nオーナー依頼: 世界の地域ごとの特産・食事（例: ローマ=カルボナーラ）を EDN でデータ化したい。superproject 全域の検索で既存データセットは不在と確認（『特産/名物/ご当地/cuisine/pizza/地理的表示』でのヒットは全て偶然一致）。地域の骨格は既に2系統: (a) ooyake gov-units（世界行政区 atlas、Wikidata provenance）、(b) cloud-itonami-municipality-<iso3>-<city> 44都市（条例 compliance カタログ、ADR-2607141700 Wave 0 以降）。選択肢は『44 repo への相乗り』vs『ooyake 側に文化専用 registry』で、オーナーが相乗りを選択した。\n\n## Decision\n\n各 municipality repo に `culture.facts` 名前空間を追加（`ordinance.facts` の sibling）:\n\n- `src/culture/facts.cljc` — catalog（正本）。helpers: `spec-basis` / `coverage` / `by-kind`\n- `schema/culture.edn` — DataScript schema（:culture/id unique identity、municipality/country/kind/url-provenance indexed）\n- `data/culture-tx.edn` — catalog からの生成物（gen-culture-tx.cljs、手書き禁止、tx-parity テストで強制）\n- `test/culture/facts_test.clj` — count / id-uniqueness / coverage honesty / by-kind / tx-parity\n- README に `## Culture catalog` 節を追加\n\nEntry shape: `:culture/{id,name,name-local(optional),municipality,country,kind,summary,url,url-provenance,retrieved-at}`、kind ∈ #{:dish :beverage :product :craft :festival :heritage}。id は `<slug>.<kind>.<item-slug>`。\n\nProvenance 規律（compliance-fact family と同一）: 全 entry の URL は retrieved-at 当日に実 fetch・実読して (a) 存在 (b) 項目一致 (c) 都市/地域との関連、を確認。summary は出典が確認する範囲のみ記述。市固有でない項目は『national dish of X, widely eaten in <city>』式に正直に記述。whc.unesco.org は bot 保護 403 のため出典に使わない（回避もしない）。捏造ゼロ — catalog にない項目は spec-basis なし。\n\n## Wave 0 実装（本 ADR と同日）\n\n- 参照実装: `cloud-itonami-municipality-ita-roma` commit `4767d47`（9 entries: dish×5 / product / beverage / festival / heritage、`clojure -M:test` 9 tests/27 assertions green、clj-kondo 0/0）\n- 残り43都市: 6並列 fresh agent（scratchpad SPEC.md 準拠、各 repo clone → 検証 → test → main へ push）\n\n## Consequences\n\n- (+) 地域 ID 体系を再発明しない。既存 compliance-fact と同じ DataScript db に union 可能\n- (+) 検証実測: 推測 Wikipedia URL の約1/3が404 — 実 fetch 検証の義務化が捏造を現実に防いだ\n- (-) compliance repo と文化データの同居（:culture/* namespace 分離で query 混線はなし）\n- (-) 44都市どまり。国レベル・都市追加は将来 wave\n- follow-up: `scripts/compliance-fact-query.cljs` SOURCES への culture 追加、44 repo の west/fleet-db 登録判断（別 ADR）\n\n## Alternatives considered\n\n- **ooyake 側に文化専用 registry** — 分離純度は高いが、オーナーが相乗りを選択（既存44 repo の可視性・都市単位ライフサイクルに文化データを揃える）。\n- **国レベル iso3166 repo への追加** — 都市粒度の依頼（ローマ/ナポリ）に合わないため初手からは外し、将来 wave とする。\n")))
